{
  "Pregnancy.Nephila.ArchQueen": "The paper-thin flesh of your stomach is now almost fully transparent as it stretches over a womb that would make the barn at Whitney's farm look like a snug fit. Your innumerable oozelike children are clearly visible squirming within you and ooze beads up through your flesh, leaving your body perpetually coated in a thin sheen of multi-colored slime. You no longer have the capacity to enter most places regularly, and find yourself relying on a magical simulacrum crafted by your nephila children to \"get around.\" It is a perfect replica of your body, but scaled down to a more manageable size. By projecting your mind into it, you are able to continue adventuring. These simulacra feed back into your real, overladen body, however, and the risk of rupture, should you continue adventuring at this size, is very real. <b>You are certain, now: it's time to embrace destiny.</b>"
}
